- First Aid;
- Epilepsy Awareness and Emergency Medication Administration (Buccal/oromuscular Midazolam), Anaphylaxis Awareness and Adrenaline Auto-Injector Administration;
- Manual Handling;
- Promoting Positive Engagement and Building Relationships;
- Mental Health Awareness and Mental Health First Aid;
- National Plant Operators Registration Scheme (NPORS);
- Driver Learning;
- The New Roads and Street Works Act 1991 (NRSWA Street Works);
- Strategic Leadership Development;
